cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "MVA Hackathon 2026: analysis code (Team DETA)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, replication harness and pre-registration records behind Team DETA's two reports for
  the SageBio MVA Hackathon 2026 (mosaic variegated aneuploidy). Track 1 interprets one child's
  whole-genome data under pre-registered, hashed decision rules; Track 2 tests therapeutic hypotheses
  against public data. The replication harness covers 47 steps and compares every result with the
  value recorded before seeing it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Team DETA"
